{"unit_id":"bitterSmilezzz__dsh-notify#card-zh","repo":"bitterSmilezzz/dsh-notify","commit":"8066a32a03e297d23cf7a100c5f686998e5b66e7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 是面向 DSH 桌面端和浏览器的通知插件，通过 client 侧 Web Notification API 订阅会话状态与错误事件，并在设置面板提供可即时调整的选项。它可提醒审批请求、等待回答、轮次完成、会话结束、错误和可选的子代理完成；通知点击可聚焦窗口并打开对应会话。还支持按事件开关、免打扰时段、通知正文详情控制和事件音效。适合需要离开当前会话时及时获知 DSH 任务进度的用户；浏览器需授予通知权限。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/notifications.ts:178-191","src/client/index.ts:80-96","src/client/settings-card.tsx:124-190"]}
{"unit_id":"bitterSmilezzz__dsh-notify#card-en","repo":"bitterSmilezzz/dsh-notify","commit":"8066a32a03e297d23cf7a100c5f686998e5b66e7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-notify adds DSH desktop alerts. It watches session and error events for approvals, questions, completed turns, ended sessions and errors, then opens the relevant session when clicked. Settings control event alerts, quiet hours, message details and sounds. Browsers need notification permission.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/notifications.ts:178-191","src/client/index.ts:80-96","src/client/settings-card.tsx:124-190"]}
